  "<div class=\"recuerda\">\n    <div class=\"recuerda-titulo\">RECUERDA</div>\n    <div class=\"recuerda-idea\">Para medir <b>longitudes</b> usamos dos unidades:</div>\n    <div class=\"recuerda-idea\">• El <b>metro (m)</b> mide cosas <b>grandes</b>: una puerta, una mesa, una habitación.</div>\n    <div class=\"recuerda-idea\">• El <b>centímetro (cm)</b> mide cosas <b>pequeñas</b>: un lápiz, un dedo, una goma.</div>\n    <div class=\"recuerda-idea\"><span class=\"rec-eq\">1 m = 100 cm</span> &nbsp;·&nbsp; Para medir con la regla, pon el objeto en el <b>0</b> y mira en qué número termina.</div>\n  </div>",
  "<div class=\"ej-block\">\n    <div class=\"ej-enunciado\"><span class=\"num\">1.</span> ¿Lo medirías en <b>metros</b> o en <b>centímetros</b>? Rodea la unidad correcta:</div>\n    <div class=\"unidad-grid\">\n      <div class=\"unidad-item\"><span class=\"unidad-obj\">El alto de una puerta</span><span class=\"unidad-ops\"><span class=\"pill\">metro</span><span class=\"pill\">cm</span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"unidad-item\"><span class=\"unidad-obj\">Un bolígrafo</span><span class=\"unidad-ops\"><span class=\"pill\">metro</span><span class=\"pill\">cm</span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"unidad-item\"><span class=\"unidad-obj\">El largo de la pizarra</span><span class=\"unidad-ops\"><span class=\"pill\">metro</span><span class=\"pill\">cm</span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"unidad-item\"><span class=\"unidad-obj\">Una cuchara</span><span class=\"unidad-ops\"><span class=\"pill\">metro</span><span class=\"pill\">cm</span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"unidad-item\"><span class=\"unidad-obj\">El largo de un campo de fútbol</span><span class=\"unidad-ops\"><span class=\"pill\">metro</span><span class=\"pill\">cm</span></span></div>\n      <div class=\"unidad-item\"><span class=\"unidad-obj\">Una goma de borrar</span><span class=\"unidad-ops\"><span class=\"pill\">metro</span><span class=\"pill\">cm</span></span></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>",
  "<div class=\"ej-block\">\n    <div class=\"ej-enunciado\"><span class=\"num\">2.</span> Mira la regla y escribe cuántos <b>centímetros</b> mide cada objeto:</div>\n      <div class=\"regla-fila\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 543 96\" width=\"100%\" style=\"max-width:543px;display:block\"><rect x=\"16\" y=\"36\" width=\"511\" height=\"38\" rx=\"5\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><line x1=\"24\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"24\" y2=\"51\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"24\" y=\"68\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><line x1=\"40.5\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"40.5\" y2=\"44\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"57\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"57\" y2=\"51\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"57\" y=\"68\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">1</text><line x1=\"73.5\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"73.5\" y2=\"44\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"90\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"51\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"90\" y=\"68\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><line x1=\"106.5\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"106.5\" y2=\"44\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"123\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"123\" y2=\"51\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"123\" y=\"68\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">3</text><line x1=\"139.5\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"139.5\" y2=\"44\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"156\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"156\" y2=\"51\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"156\" y=\"68\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"11\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><line x1=\"172.5\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"172.5\" y2=\"44\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"1\"/><line x1=\"189\" y1=\"36\" x2=\"189\" y2=\"51\" stroke=\"#000\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"189\" y=\"68\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" fo